# 🎧 AI Music Remix & Mood Generator

##  Project Overview
Music remixing and creation usually require technical expertise and professional software, which many students do not have access to.  
This project aims to build an **AI-powered web application** that allows users to generate or remix music based on **mood and genre**, enabling creative expression without deep technical knowledge.

The system uses **emotion analysis in music** to understand mood and provide suitable music outputs and remix effects.

---

##  Objectives
- To analyze music emotions using **valence–arousal modeling**
- To classify music into mood categories such as **Happy, Sad, Calm, and Energetic**
- To build a web-based interface where users can interact with music using mood and genre selection
- To demonstrate AI-assisted music remixing in a simple and user-friendly way

---

